{
  "worlds": [],
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "wordwood.gates",
      "world": "wordwood",
      "title": "The Twin Gates",
      "kind": "main",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "shut",
          "objective": "Talk to Shut at the foot of the tree: `Enter`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.met-shut",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "note",
          "objective": "Try the left ) under Shut: press `%`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.knows-pair",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ope",
          "objective": "Find Ope: `%` back down, then `%` on the right ).",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.asked",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "lamp-a",
          "objective": "Light the lower lamp in the trunk: `Ctrl-d`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.lamp-a",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "lamp-b",
          "objective": "Light the upper lamp: `Ctrl-u`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.lamp-b",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "tell",
          "objective": "Tell Shut: `G`, walk next to him, `Enter`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "flag",
            "flag": "gates.shut-ready",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "open",
          "objective": "Go back up to Ope: on the right ), press `%`.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "stage-cleared",
            "stage": "gates"
          },
          "then": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "gates.intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "A hollow tree, taller than the canopy. You need\nthe gate at its foot, and its keeper is asleep."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Gate's shut. It takes two to open, and there's\nonly me. A bracket with no partner is an error.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Don't believe me? Go on. Nothing will happen.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Each ) down here is half of a pair. Stand on the\nleft one and press `%`: you jump to its partner."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.met-shut",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-alone",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Still only me down here.\nThe trunk's been dark since the Flicker.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.top",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The top. From the right ) to this (: one pair,\nwith the whole trunk between. And a keeper."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-ask",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "A visitor? From below? Nothing's below. I open,\nnobody shuts. That's the tragedy.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "A brother? Light the trunk lamps and I'll\nbelieve you. Lower one first, then the upper.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Stand over the hollow, top of the trunk. Press\n`Ctrl-d` four times: down to the lower lamp."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.met-shut",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.knows-pair",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.asked",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-wait",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Lower lamp, then upper. Then ask the nobody\ndown there what he sees.",
          "name": "Ope"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.lamp-a",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The lower lamp catches."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Now the upper lamp. Press `Ctrl-u` twice:\nhalf a screen up each time."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "world",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "remove-entity",
              "entity": "lamp-a"
            },
            {
              "type": "spawn",
              "entity": {
                "id": "lamp-a",
                "kind": "prop",
                "sprite": "lamp-lit",
                "at": {
                  "line": 24,
                  "col": 4
                },
                "behaviour": {
                  "type": "still"
                },
                "every": 1,
                "damage": 0,
                "solid": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.lamp-a",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.lamp-b",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The upper lamp takes the flame.\nThe whole trunk glows."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "world",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "remove-entity",
              "entity": "lamp-b"
            },
            {
              "type": "spawn",
              "entity": {
                "id": "lamp-b",
                "kind": "prop",
                "sprite": "lamp-lit",
                "at": {
                  "line": 12,
                  "col": 4
                },
                "behaviour": {
                  "type": "still"
                },
                "every": 1,
                "damage": 0,
                "solid": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.lamp-b",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-sees",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Light, in the trunk. Someone lit the upper\nlamp. You can't reach it from here.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "...Unless you came down from above.\nUnless there is an above.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Tell him: on three. I never stopped counting.\nI only stopped believing.",
          "name": "Shut"
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.met-shut",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.shut-ready",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.shut-go",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Go on. Up you go. On three.",
          "name": "Shut"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Stand on the right ). Press `%`: you jump to\nOpe's (, its partner."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.ope-cure",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "On three? He said on three?\nOnly Shut says on three.",
          "name": "Ope"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "You tell him what you did: a lamp lit, a road\ncleared, two lamps in a hollow trunk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "One... two...",
          "name": "Ope"
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.open",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "Page 3. He fell asleep before the end of this\nchapter. I finished it for the empty room."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The inner pair is this nook. The outer pair is\nthe tree: its ( is at the very top."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.nook",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "From the left ) to this (: a pair. Press `%`\nhere and it takes you back."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The right ) has a partner too, too far up to\nsee. `%` finds it all the same."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "gates.knows-pair",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.crack",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Through a knothole: one gate, whole.\nOne keeper, asleep against it."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "gates.death-hint",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Blot on the landing! Wait for it to step aside,\nthen `Ctrl-u` or `Ctrl-d`: half a screen."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    }
  ],
